{"id":"wb-6-816","name":"碧落寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"碧落寺","text":"碧落寺位于中国山西省晋城市泽州县巴公镇南连氏村，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n碧落寺始建于北齐，盛于唐，曾名列古代泽州四大寺之首。寺坐北朝南，分东、中、西三院，现存北齐石窟一座、唐代石窟两座、唐代石龛十余龛、明代石拱桥两座，其它建筑多为清代及现代建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A2%A7%E8%90%BD%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":89061420,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89061420","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/43fa787e7feabdfbfd1fa296.jpg","title":"20250906_Biluo_Temple_03.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20250906_Biluo_Temple_03.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/20250906_Biluo_Temple_03.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​碧落寺 西窟（北齐）","width":320,"height":213}}